{"id":1152,"bodyHtml":"<div><div><div><div><p>2023年11月，体育学院院长吴剑、党委副书记贾鹏等一行3人前往校友企业山西中标法兰锻业有限公司、苏州深岩食品有限公司走访交流。</p><p>走访过程中，吴院长一行向企业介绍了学院的专业设置、办学特色、人才培养和招生就业情况，并详细了解了各企业的发展历程、业务领域、企业文化、公司经营情况及用人需求，结合学院人才培养与企业用人需求的契合度，进行深入的校企合作交流。吴院长希望双方在产学研、人才培养、学历提升以及就创业服务等方面进行全方位深度合作，并建立校友担任在校生导师制度，积极为毕业生创造更大的成长和发展空间，助力在校生培养，搭建更好的平台为毕业生就业、创业提供服务。</p><p>此次走访交流活动进一步增进了学院与企业单位的联系，为学院学科建设、学生实习就业、校企产学研合作开拓了思路，同时也为后续深入开展合作交流奠定了良好的基础。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=PM7CYYolCZnNVkL47rRM8QRLzLsnR-84ol-ZL4-snlV7LzL0gihFp2hmCIa0okhVn1ysUSyPUmLPnmUPMRWRLzf2nlMkM8CZnRf7UlLbMmrFUlM2LlCPozAFLlL4MmLJqjfjo4Oeosnb_dN0qIbtpYyPLRUbg47YL4GbgtA8pUicc&oid=1054562613&tid=1049&nid=12309&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/8EF7A1B31F4142C10FECB7F8D0DAC965/ACF1F198/1C363\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"500\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=PnlMYRUz7DnzQ7L47UiUmWVL8lsnRl88L7-4nzVkMmliLRG0gihFp2hmCIa0n1hRn1hRnkhkUlV2LRN8UlU4L4-bMmT7MRNiM7LioRVfL4rFMmM2nRVfLRMFMRvDoz94gtXaQ4Oeo4x8_5AbgDTJQty0LzG8oSyPLmLaoSbw62i8c&oid=1054562613&tid=1049&nid=12309&e=.jpg\"><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=PLmTYRolnkUz6fU48nkMlU4U4N8Um98io7CboRUaozn2oRl0gihFp2hmCIa0U1ybMky8okyPUlL8ozfkMRUPnNn7LNU8M8nkM4CDLRUiL4nFLz7sU4lYMznFUN7Dn77Jqjfjo4Oeosnb_dN0qIbtpYyPLRUbg47YL4GbgtA8pUicc&oid=1054562613&tid=1049&nid=12309&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/B94481AC490B441FDD2D47DB76604534/117C5254/BA6DA\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"500\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=PLmTYRolnkUz6fU48nkMlU4U4N8Um98io7CboRUaozn2oRl0gihFp2hmCIa0U1ybMky8okyPUlL8ozfkMRUPnNn7LNU8M8nkM4CDLRUiL4nFLz7sU4lYMznFUN7Dn77Jqjfjo4Oeosnb_dN0qIbtpYyPLRUbg47YL4GbgtA8pUicc&oid=1054562613&tid=1049&nid=12309&e=.jpg\"></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=PMz9YiL4WkMmLio4zfkUznfL87PUzC8Po7-PM4A2LlUZozN0gihFp2hmCIa0UShkLYyZMSh7MNLaolVfMlUaLRLPnllPnmQRLNUiUmnRLNQFn7-8M77bo7QFLzLbolCJqjfjo4Oeosnb_dN0qIbtpYyPLRUbg47YL4GbgtA8pUicc&oid=1054562613&tid=1049&nid=12309&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/AB385D6C09AA5D0031EE1F6C2D